ife - PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5884689)\n38. [Synthesis and breakdown of universal metabolic precursors promoted by iron - PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6517266/)\n39. [(PDF) Quantifying Reductive Amination in Nonenzymatic Amino Acid Synthesis](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/363673133_Quantifying_Reductive_Amination_in_Nonenzymatic_Amino_Acid_Synthesis)\n40. [Method and deregulated enzyme for threonine production](https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/6649379)\n41. [A new family of extraterrestrial amino acids in the Murchison meteorite](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-017-00693-9)\n42. [(PDF) A new family of extraterrestrial amino acids in the Murchison meteorite](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/315902003_A_new_family_of_extraterrestrial_amino_acids_in_the_Murchison_meteorite)\n43. [Extraterrestrial amino acids and L\u2010enantiomeric excesses in the \\<fc\\>CM\\</fc\\>2 carbonaceous chondrites Aguas Zarcas and Murchison - Glavin - 2021 - Meteoritics & Planetary Science - Wiley Online Library](https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/maps.13451)\n44. [Molecular asymmetry in extraterrestrial chemistry: Insights from a pristine meteorite](https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.0709909105)\n45. [Life's Building Blocks Found in Bennu Samples - Eos.org](https://eos.org/articles/lifes-building-blocks-found-in-bennu-samples)\n46. [Extraterrestrial amino acids evolve differently in asteroid Bennu and Ryugu: Possible mechanisms and future perspectives - ScienceDirect](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2667325826004255)\n47. [Extraterrestrial amino acids and amines identi\ufb01ed in asteroid Ryugu](https://science.gsfc.nasa.gov/sed/content/uploadFiles/publication_files/Parker2023.pdf)\n48. [Gamma-Ray-Induced Amino Acid Formation during Aqueous Alteration in Small Bodies: The Effects of Compositions of Starting Solutions - PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC